From 26cf14475facda055955d327a429e3f3739d6c9f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: David Do <david.do@openkingdom.com>
Date: Thu, 27 Aug 2026 23:08:52 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 20/21] netgen: sinh .env cung compose, va CHAN mang THAT sinh
 ra o tu the phoi tran
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

VI SAO: netgen sinh docker-compose.multinode.yml nhung KHONG sinh .env. Compose tu nap .env
tu thu muc chua tep compose, va moi bien trong do deu co mac dinh KEM AN TOAN HON:

    --http-allowed-hosts=${A1_HTTP_ALLOWED_HOSTS:-*}
    ports: "${A1_API_BIND:-127.0.0.1}:9650:9650"

=> Thieu .env thi mang van len, 9/9 node xanh, khong mot dong loi nao — nhung bo loc Host
cua node CONG KHAI mo thanh *. Luot g0 (27/08) thoat chi vi co nguoi nho chep tay .env tu
thu muc mang cu sang. TRI NHO KHONG PHAI MOT CONG.

THEM:
  1. netgen sinh <out>/.env voi A1_CONFIG_DIR · A1_API_BIND · A1_HTTP_ALLOWED_HOSTS ·
     A1_TRACK_SUBNETS. Ba bien dau doc tu chinh moi truong netgen, CUNG TEN voi bien no ghi
     ra — nguoi van hanh chi phai nho mot bo ten. Mac dinh TRUNG mac dinh cua compose, de
     viec sinh .env tu no khong tro thanh mot thay doi hanh vi am tham.
  2. CONG kiemPhoiTran: mang THAT khong duoc sinh voi A1_HTTP_ALLOWED_HOSTS=* hoac
     A1_API_BIND=0.0.0.0 — DUNG CUNG. Mang TAP cho qua kem canh bao. Khong co co "toi biet
     toi dang lam gi": mo that thi mo luc `up` bang --env-file cua rieng luot do, dung nuong
     vao vat lieu sinh mang.
  3. NETWORK_ID nay BAT BUOC. Truoc do mac dinh "9001" — networkID cua the he DA CHET, ma
     chinh cong bo dinh danh tu choi. Hanh vi "netgen tran thi dung" la DUNG nhung dung do
     TAI NAN, va thong bao loi noi ve mot con so nguoi dung chua tung go. Te hon: chu thich
     dau tep khai mac dinh la constants.A1ID — tuc tai lieu mo ta mot hanh vi ma neu ai do
     "sua cho khop" thi netgen tran se lang le sinh ra MANG THAT.

KHONG kiem A1_CONFIG_DIR, va noi ro vi sao: netgen chay trong container ghi ra /out, con
duong dan do duoc compose giai tren MAY CHU. Chi chep lai gia tri va IN TO ra. Dung them mot
phep kiem gia vo o day.

NGHIEM THU — 6 ca, 3 DO 3 XANH, va cap do/xanh DOI XUNG (cung tham so, khac bang):
  1 XANH mang that mac dinh          -> .env dung 4 bien
  2 DO   mang that + allowed-hosts=* -> FATAL, va KHONG ghi .env nao ca
  3 DO   mang that + api-bind=0.0.0.0-> FATAL
  4 XANH mang TAP + cung tham so ca 2-> cho qua, co canh bao
  5 DO   khong khai NETWORK_ID       -> FATAL
  6 XANH A1_CONFIG_DIR tuong minh    -> chep dung vao .env

DAU-CUOI (do bang `docker compose config`, khong doc ma):
  co .env    -> --http-allowed-hosts=localhost,127.0.0.1
  giau .env  -> --http-allowed-hosts=*        <- dung su co suyt xay ra 27/08

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
